### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@contentType = application/json
# Colle un access token obtenu via auth.http (POST /auth/login)
@accessToken = COLLE_TON_ACCESS_TOKEN_ICI

### 1. Consulter son profil
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 2. Modifier son pseudo
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "pseudo": "jane_updated"
}

### 3. Modifier sa photo de profil
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "photoProfilUrl": "https://cdn.example.com/avatars/jane.jpg"
}

### 4. Sans token — doit renvoyer 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me

### 5. Pseudo déjà utilisé — doit renvoyer 409
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "pseudo": "un_pseudo_deja_pris_par_un_autre_compte"
}